        {"zh": "你撞得我肚子发晃。", "en": "You rattled my belly."},
        {"zh": "我把肚子抖了一下。", "en": "I give my abdomen a shake."},
        {"zh": "我们的肚子挤在一起。", "en": "Our abdomens squash together."},
        {"zh": "我爬回刚才趴的地方。", "en": "I crawl back to where I was lying."},
        {"zh": "我没有吐，忍住了。", "en": "I didn't spit — I held it."}
