        {"zh": "它的口器也在滴。", "en": "Its mouthparts are dripping too."},
        {"zh": "后来它先动了。", "en": "Then it moved first."},
        {"zh": "我趴回原来的石面。", "en": "I settle back on the stone."},
        {"zh": "我们各自回去。", "en": "We go our separate ways."}
      ]
